{
  "source": "Prompts/what-is-ai-5.mp4",
  "duration": 182.6249375,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.92,
      "text": "You need to start your next history project, but you haven't picked a topic."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.66,
      "end": 7.76,
      "text": "You look around the room for inspiration. Ask your desk,"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.5,
      "end": 11.98,
      "text": "give me 10 ideas for my next history project. Nothing."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.46,
      "end": 16.1,
      "text": "It's a desk. Ask a friend, and they can help you"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.1,
      "end": 20.0,
      "text": "brainstorm. Ask AI, and it can give you a list in"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.0,
      "end": 23.16,
      "text": "seconds. This board compares the two approaches."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.92,
      "end": 27.56,
      "text": "Left, your prompt to the physical desk gets zero ideas."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.18,
      "end": 31.78,
      "text": "Right, exact same instructions to AI gives you"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.78,
      "end": 35.52,
      "text": "10 history project ideas. Ancient Egypt, the printing"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.52,
      "end": 39.66,
      "text": "press, the silk road, the moon landing, the Roman Empire,"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.26,
      "end": 43.54,
      "text": "the industrial revolution, the civil rights movement, the"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.54,
      "end": 47.34,
      "text": "history of voting, the invention of flight, and the Berlin Wall."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.38,
      "end": 51.56,
      "text": "AI is software built to do things that used to take a human"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.56,
      "end": 55.7,
      "text": "brain. It can understand a question, summarize a long document,"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.7,
      "end": 59.82,
      "text": "or translate a conversation. That doesn't mean it actually thinks"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.82,
      "end": 63.58,
      "text": "like your friend, or that all 10 of those history ideas will be good."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.24,
      "end": 67.86,
      "text": "You simply have a tool that can help with cognitive tasks that once"
    },
    {
      "start": 67.86,
      "end": 71.66,
      "text": "required a person. Different AI systems do different jobs."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.28,
      "end": 75.8,
      "text": "Let's look at two kinds you already use. This graphic breaks"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.8,
      "end": 79.96,
      "text": "down these tools into two main categories. First is recommendation"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.96,
      "end": 83.56,
      "text": "AI. Its job is to choose from what already exists."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.56,
      "end": 87.6,
      "text": "It works by ranking the available options and selecting the"
    },
    {
      "start": 87.6,
      "end": 91.5,
      "text": "likely best match for you. You see this every day when you get a suggested"
    },
    {
      "start": 91.5,
      "end": 94.68,
      "text": "Netflix show, a Spotify song, or a maps route."
    },
    {
      "start": 95.6,
      "end": 99.82,
      "text": "Then there is generative AI. Its job is to make something that didn't exist."
    },
    {
      "start": 100.52,
      "end": 103.72,
      "text": "It uses learned patterns to create a new output from your prompt."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.44,
      "end": 107.72,
      "text": "A prompt is simply the question or set of instructions you give it."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.26,
      "end": 111.1,
      "text": "This can result in a brand new email, an essay,"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.1,
      "end": 114.66,
      "text": "an image, a website, a song, or a video."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.64,
      "end": 118.26,
      "text": "AI can recommend. AI can create."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.0,
      "end": 123.22,
      "text": "This course focuses on generative AI. Here's what that difference looks like."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.74,
      "end": 127.28,
      "text": "This board shows what happens when we apply both tools to a single scenario."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.06,
      "end": 131.08,
      "text": "You're in the mood for superheroes. Recommendation AI"
    },
    {
      "start": 131.08,
      "end": 134.84,
      "text": "takes this scenario and attempts to find a superhero movie you might enjoy."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.38,
      "end": 139.42,
      "text": "Think about how your streaming app handles this kind of request. It points you to"
    },
    {
      "start": 139.42,
      "end": 143.66,
      "text": "Captain America Civil War. It selected a movie from an existing catalog"
    },
    {
      "start": 143.66,
      "end": 147.58,
      "text": "based on your past interests. It picked a movie that already exists."
    },
    {
      "start": 148.5,
      "end": 151.54,
      "text": "Generative AI takes that exact same scenario and"
    },
    {
      "start": 151.54,
      "end": 155.22,
      "text": "writes a brand new scene about two superhero teammates who disagree."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.86,
      "end": 159.62,
      "text": "You get a script. We save the bridge, Maya said. The hospital"
    },
    {
      "start": 159.62,
      "end": 162.9,
      "text": "loses power in three minutes, Leo replied. We can't do both."
    },
    {
      "start": 163.58,
      "end": 167.46,
      "text": "It generated a scene from your request. One helps you find something"
    },
    {
      "start": 167.46,
      "end": 170.48,
      "text": "to watch. The other helps you create a story of your own."
    },
    {
      "start": 171.18,
      "end": 174.68,
      "text": "This leaves us with a very simple rule to remember. Two kinds."
    },
    {
      "start": 175.12,
      "end": 179.02,
      "text": "One picks. One creates. This course is about the one that creates."
    }
  ],
